       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TRNERR.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TRANS-ID     PIC X(10) VALUE "TXN-902108".
       01 WS-ACCT-NUM     PIC X(12) VALUE "ACT-0000000".
       01 WS-ERR-CODE     PIC X(10) VALUE "ERR-404-NF".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "=== TRANSACTION BATCH PROCESSOR (TRNERR) ===".
           DISPLAY "STEP 1: READING TRANSACTION RECORD...".
           ACCEPT WS-TRANS-ID.
           DISPLAY "TXN ID     : " WS-TRANS-ID.
           DISPLAY "STEP 2: VALIDATING ACCOUNT IN MASTER LEDGER...".
           DISPLAY "ACCOUNT    : " WS-ACCT-NUM.
           DISPLAY "CRITICAL ERROR [E008]: UNKNOWN ACCOUNT".
           DISPLAY "DIAGNOSTIC : ACCOUNT NOT FOUND IN MASTER FILE".
           DISPLAY "ACTION     : TRANSACTION POSTING REJECTED".
           DISPLAY "RECOVERY   : SENT TO MANUAL REPAIR QUEUE".
           DISPLAY "=== BATCH HALTED: RC 0008 (CRITICAL ERROR) ===".
           MOVE 8 TO RETURN-CODE.
           STOP RUN.
